      "resource": "unknown",
      "resource_status": "unknown",
      "summary": "- With `AGENT_SLACK_SAFE_MODE=1` (or the global `--safe-mode` flag) set, safe mode is enforced at the tool level: `message send` is redirected to the draft editor and `message edit`/`message delete` are blocked. Use it when nothing should post without human review.",
